        <mxCell id="legend" parent="aws-cloud" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontSize=9;fontColor=#333333;" value="&lt;b&gt;InteliSrcPA - PRD (Production) Environment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;App ID: 22272 | Owner: Fernando Hidalgo | CostString: 1741.PA.135.601000&lt;br&gt;Naming: eec-aws-us-eits-intelisrcpa-prd&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scheduling:&lt;/b&gt; EC2 = us-east-office-hours (ASG - CPU Target Tracking 70%)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Encryption:&lt;/b&gt; All data at rest encrypted with KMS (auto-rotation, 30d deletion window)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;RDS Config:&lt;/b&gt; SQL Server SE 15, force_ssl=1, MAXDOP=8, License-Included, TZ=SA Pacific, Enhanced Monitoring 60s&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;RDS Features:&lt;/b&gt; SSIS + SSRS (8443) + Backup/Restore; produccion tambien TDE&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ALB:&lt;/b&gt; HTTPS:443 (TLS termination, SNI) + HTTP:80 - host-based routing to 7 apps&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ACM:&lt;/b&gt; 11 certificates (1 per public host_header), external DNS validation&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Standalone EC2:&lt;/b&gt; 3 Windows instances (PFSWES08/09, PAPWES34) - fixed IP, no FSx&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;FSx:&lt;/b&gt; 1x Single-AZ (DFS-R enabled) - AD Integrated (gdc.local) - 100GB SSD, 64 MB/s, own CMK&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;DMS:&lt;/b&gt; CDC one-way On-Premises to RDS produccion - dms.c5.2xlarge, engine 3.6.1&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;AD Integration:&lt;/b&gt; Self-managed AD (gdc.local) via Secrets Manager&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;DR Strategy:&lt;/b&gt; DFS-R from FSx (AWS) to On-Premise File Servers via VPN/Direct Connect" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="235" width="600" x="630" y="1450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="color-legend" parent="aws-cloud" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontSize=9;fontColor=#333333;" value="&lt;b&gt;Connection Legend:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ED7100&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; Compute traffic (ALB/users to ASG instances)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C925D1&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; Database connections (TCP 1433 / SSRS 8443)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#3F8624&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; Storage (RDS to S3, ASG to FSx SMB/DFS)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#DD344C&quot;&gt;- - -&lt;/font&gt; Security (Secrets/KMS/AD/ACM)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E7157B&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; Operations (Backup/ACM alerts to SNS, EventBridge to Lambda)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#8C4FFF&quot;&gt;- - -&lt;/font&gt; DFS-R Replication (AWS to On-Premise)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#01A88D&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; DMS Replication (CDC On-Prem to RDS)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#3F8624&quot;&gt;- - -&lt;/font&gt; AWS Backup target (tag-based selection)" vertex="1">
